# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Paired isolated DEMO only, fresh state, starting folded in inbox.
# Never run this on the Mac Pro while Boss's simulator ban is in force.
# Record native video concurrently; use frame PTS, not nominal FPS, for visual review.
# See docs/messages-imessage-parity-build.md: this walk does not prove 120Hz/latency.
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
expect Ana Demo
tap Ana Demo
expect Perfect, see you there
shot reference-chat-open card=messages-parity-status
# Native IME controls layout; no second timed inset animator.
tap Message
type Reference motion draft
keyboard shown
shot reference-keyboard-up card=messages-parity-status
closeime
keyboard hidden
expect Reference motion draft
shot reference-keyboard-down card=messages-parity-status
tap Send
expect Reference motion draft
wait 600
shot reference-send-settled card=messages-parity-send-motion
hold Perfect, see you there
expect Tapback like
shot reference-hold-menu card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
key BACK
absent Tapback like
expect Perfect, see you there
doubletap Perfect, see you there
expect Tapback like
shot reference-doubletap-existing-menu card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
key BACK
absent Tapback like
keyboard hidden
key BACK
expect Ana Demo
shot reference-back-list
tap Ana Demo
expect Reference motion draft
key BACK
expect Ana Demo
# Cancel predictive Back by returning to the edge BEFORE lifting the same contact.
# A one-way edge swipe ending at 12% legitimately committed on this gesture-nav AVD.
# Folded fixture is 1248x1972: x=25 -> 400 -> 25, y=986. No intervening UP/DOWN.
# Space samples by 150ms: an unpaced chain completed in 191ms and did not render a return.
# Each input command must succeed; && makes shell failure fail this step.
tap Ana Demo
expect Perfect, see you there
shell input touchscreen motionevent DOWN 25 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 150 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 275 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 400 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 275 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 150 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent MOVE 25 986 && sleep 0.15 && input touchscreen motionevent UP 25 986
expect Perfect, see you there
shot reference-back-cancel card=messages-parity-status
# Cancellation must leave the composer usable, with no surprise IME reopening.
keyboard hidden
tap Message
keyboard shown
closeime
keyboard hidden
expect Perfect, see you there
# Device settings: repeat open/back/send/menu with animator duration scale 0,
# then restore the prior scale. Do not change Boss's phone settings.
# Reduced-motion/device frame review remains an explicit native-walk check.
